<title>UK: Slovenia sets 300 million mark seven-year bond. [CORRECTED 12:01 GMT]</title>
<headline>Slovenia sets 300 million mark seven-year bond. [CORRECTED 12:01 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers CSFB and Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   REPUBLIC OF SLOVENIA</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN MARKS COUPON     5.75 PCT  MATURITY    16.JUN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.443   PAY DATE    16.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.75	REOFFER    99.043    SPREAD	+43 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A3	  LISTING    FFT	 GOV LAW    GERMAN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.35	SELL CONC  1.90	LISTING     0.5</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.75 PCT TREUHAND (corrects from 6.75 pct bund)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
